<title>CHINA: Giordano Int'l interim net rises 16 pct.</title>
<headline>Giordano Int'l interim net rises 16 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   18.00    vs  15.54</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    5.0	vs  4.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    127.70   vs  110.08</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,673.07 vs  1,733.60</p>
<p>    Company name		 Giordano International Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  August 11-13</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   August 27</p>
<p>NOTE - Giordano International is a casual apparel retailer.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
